1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,210
The homeroom
teacher's coming!

2
00:00:01,293 --> 00:00:02,293
Come on, he's coming up!

3
00:00:07,246 --> 00:00:08,550
Jeez…

4
00:00:08,966 --> 00:00:10,045
You punks!

5
00:00:10,385 --> 00:00:12,040
What are you guys
doing here?

6
00:00:12,902 --> 00:00:14,092
Unbelievable…

7
00:00:16,099 --> 00:00:17,219
You were smoking
weren't you?

8
00:00:18,678 --> 00:00:19,269
Huh?

9
00:00:19,352 --> 00:00:21,723
I said no smoking
on the roof!

10
00:00:22,057 --> 00:00:23,504
Give me a break!

11
00:00:29,571 --> 00:00:30,571
I've had enough

12
00:00:31,080 --> 00:00:32,384
I need to teach
him a lesson

13
00:00:34,104 --> 00:00:35,104
Who?

14
00:00:35,744 --> 00:00:36,744
Hong Il-tak

15
00:00:37,637 --> 00:00:39,237
He's forgotten
who his friend is

16
00:00:41,959 --> 00:00:43,461
[A channel
for cool people]

17
00:00:43,544 --> 00:00:45,310
[You too can be a real man!]

18
00:00:48,763 --> 00:00:50,617
What happened before
made me realize it

19
00:00:51,271 --> 00:00:52,170
Everything comes down

20
00:00:52,254 --> 00:00:55,038
to pure physical
strength here

21
00:00:57,711 --> 00:01:00,859
I have to get
stronger to survive

22
00:01:09,006 --> 00:01:10,920
S***, where is he?

23
00:01:17,611 --> 00:01:19,350
You're in my way
you loser!
